OL,4,CNigeria's president says he is also    
OL,5,Chit by water and power cuts plaguing   
OL,6,Ccountry                                
OL,7,GNigeria's President Bola Tinubu says   
OL,8,Gthe presidential villa suffers from    
OL,9,Gcuts in electricity and water - issues 
OL,10,Gthat are all too common for the        
OL,11,Gcountry's ordinary citizens.           
OL,13,FHe said he was shaving last week when  
OL,14,Fthe water supply cut at the villa,     
OL,15,Fknown as Aso Rock, in Abuja.           
OL,17,FHe is seeking re-election next January 
OL,18,Fand vowed to address these issues.     
